== Plugins ==

===Highlight special attacks===
Using the [https://runelite.net/plugin-hub/show/better-npc-highlight Better NPC Highlight] plugin, you can highlight Vardorvis special attacks. You can highlight the true tiles and optionally colour-code them using preset colours.

==== Swinging Axes ====
Use NPC ID <code>12225</code> when the axes are static, and <code>12227</code> when they are moving.

==== Vardorvis' Head ====
Use NPC ID <code>12226</code> to highlight [[Vardorvis' Head]].

===Hide pillars===
Use [https://runelite.net/plugin-hub/show/dt2-mistake-tracker DT2 Boss Utilities] plugin to hide the pillars.

